<urn:aspace:01-projects-picard-05-marina-cleaning-bos-sop-b2-business-domains-06-finance-wonderwoman-thunderbolts-05-marina-finance-transverse-money-control-os-md> a aspace:Document ;
    rdfs:label "MARINA Finance Transverse Money Control OS  ## Purpose Finance is the transverse money gate for 05 Marina Cleaning BOS & SOP. It ensures pricing, margin, costs, cash timing, payment terms, refunds, taxes, approvals, and leakage controls are explicit before B2/B3 work becomes operational.  ## Operating Thesis Marina needs Finance to make job pricing, crew labor, supplies, travel, equipment, payment timing, margin, and leakage visible before field delivery.  ## Eight-Domain Finance Interface | Domain | Finance Surface | Required Proof | | --- | --- | --- |" ;
    aspace:seau <urn:aspace:01-projects-picard> ;
    dct:modified "2026-06-02" ;
    aspace:mots 303 .

<urn:aspace:01-projects-picard-05-marina-cleaning-bos-sop-b2-business-domains-06-finance-wonderwoman-thunderbolts-06-marina-b2-b3-finance-approval-protocol-md> a aspace:Document ;
    rdfs:label "MARINA B2/B3 Finance Approval Protocol  ## Finance Packet Every B2/B3 task that touches price, cost, spend, payment, refund, tax, labor, tooling, margin, cash, quote, invoice, or financial commitment must carry this packet:  project: 05 Marina Cleaning BOS & SOP b2_domain: b2_owner: b3_agent: money_surface: price_or_budget: cost_components: margin_or_unit_economics: payment_terms: refund_or_exception_boundary: tax_or_legal_dependency: approval_owner: proof_required: decision:  ## Assignment Rules | Rule | Standard | | --- | --- | | One money surface | The financial category is explicit | | One approval owner | Spend/price/payment authority is named | | One model | Price, cost, and margin proof are attached | | One exception path | Refund/leakage/tax risk has escalation | | One decision | Ready, needs model, or blocked leakage |  ## Refusal Conditions Finance blocks execution when: - price or budget is missing; - cost-to-serve is unknown; - margin is negative or unproven; - payment/refund terms are vague; - labor or tooling is unpriced; - tax/legal/entity dependency is unresolved; - approval authority is unclear.  ## Output Finance emits one of three states: - FINANCE_READY: B3 can execute inside the named money boundary. - NEEDS_MODEL: work returns to Finance/B2 for pricing/cost proof. - BLOCKED_LEAKAGE: work routes to Donna/DLQ or B1." ;
    aspace:seau <urn:aspace:01-projects-picard> ;
    dct:modified "2026-06-02" ;
    aspace:mots 162 .

