    rdfs:label "MARINA Product Transverse Offer Boundary OS  ## Purpose Product is the transverse offer boundary gate for 05 Marina Cleaning BOS & SOP. It converts demand and sales intent into a scoped, testable, deliverable, supportable, priced, and legally bounded product/service system.  ## Operating Thesis Marina needs Product to package cleaning services, SOPs, QA, equipment, exclusions, and client walkthrough criteria.  ## Eight-Domain Product Interface | Domain | Product Surface | Required Proof | | --- | --- | --- |" ;
