    rdfs:label "MARINA Sales Transverse Revenue Handoff OS  ## Purpose Sales is the transverse revenue handoff gate for 05 Marina Cleaning BOS & SOP. It converts qualified demand into bounded proposals, commitments, and handoffs without breaking Growth, Product, Ops, IT, Finance, People, or Legal constraints.  ## Operating Thesis Marina needs Sales to qualify cleaning jobs, quote accurately, set expectations, and hand off field-ready work.  ## Eight-Domain Sales Interface | Domain | Sales Surface | Required Proof | | --- | --- | --- |" ;
    aspace:seau <urn:aspace:01-projects-picard> ;
