<urn:aspace:01-projects-picard-04-alikaly-bana-holding-to-llc-b3-warp-core-execution-02-sales-martianmanhunter-illuminati-jtbd-002-alikaly-transverse-sales-revenue-gate-md> a aspace:Document ;
    rdfs:label "JTBD-002 ALIKALY Transverse Sales Revenue Gate  ## Job When 04 Alikaly Bana Holding to LLC prepares any proposal, quote, commitment, sales script, close motion, or revenue handoff, Sales must verify qualification and cross-domain readiness.  ## Output A dated Sales readiness decision: - SALES_READY - NEEDS_QUALIFICATION - BLOCKED_COMMITMENT  ## Readiness Checks | Check | Question | | --- | --- | | Diagnostic | What pain/fit evidence exists? | | Authority | Who can decide? | | Scope | What is included/excluded? | | Price | What is quoted and approved? | | Delivery | Can Product/Ops deliver? | | Legal | Are claims/terms safe? | | Handoff | Who owns next step? |  ## Guardrail No stakeholder proposal, public narrative, or commitment may move without authority, Legal/Finance/J03 boundary, and decision log.  ## Proof Attach Sales packet, proposal, cross-domain approvals, and final Sales decision." ;
    aspace:seau <urn:aspace:01-projects-picard> ;
    dct:modified "2026-06-02" ;
    aspace:mots 106 .

