<urn:aspace:01-projects-picard-04-alikaly-bana-holding-to-llc-b2-business-domains-06-finance-wonderwoman-thunderbolts-05-alikaly-finance-transverse-money-control-os-md> a aspace:Document ;
    rdfs:label "ALIKALY Finance Transverse Money Control OS  ## Purpose Finance is the transverse money gate for 04 Alikaly Bana Holding to LLC. It ensures pricing, margin, costs, cash timing, payment terms, refunds, taxes, approvals, and leakage controls are explicit before B2/B3 work becomes operational.  ## Operating Thesis Alikaly needs Finance to coordinate entity money flows, taxes, asset records, banking, filing costs, family governance, and J03 dependencies without pretending legal/tax certainty.  ## Eight-Domain Finance Interface | Domain | Finance Surface | Required Proof | | --- | --- | --- |" ;
    aspace:seau <urn:aspace:01-projects-picard> ;
    dct:modified "2026-06-02" ;
    aspace:mots 304 .

<urn:aspace:01-projects-picard-04-alikaly-bana-holding-to-llc-b2-business-domains-06-finance-wonderwoman-thunderbolts-06-alikaly-b2-b3-finance-approval-protocol-md> a aspace:Document ;
    rdfs:label "ALIKALY B2/B3 Finance Approval Protocol  ## Finance Packet Every B2/B3 task that touches price, cost, spend, payment, refund, tax, labor, tooling, margin, cash, quote, invoice, or financial commitment must carry this packet:  project: 04 Alikaly Bana Holding to LLC b2_domain: b2_owner: b3_agent: money_surface: price_or_budget: cost_components: margin_or_unit_economics: payment_terms: refund_or_exception_boundary: tax_or_legal_dependency: approval_owner: proof_required: decision:  ## Assignment Rules | Rule | Standard | | --- | --- | | One money surface | The financial category is explicit | | One approval owner | Spend/price/payment authority is named | | One model | Price, cost, and margin proof are attached | | One exception path | Refund/leakage/tax risk has escalation | | One decision | Ready, needs model, or blocked leakage |  ## Refusal Conditions Finance blocks execution when: - price or budget is missing; - cost-to-serve is unknown; - margin is negative or unproven; - payment/refund terms are vague; - labor or tooling is unpriced; - tax/legal/entity dependency is unresolved; - approval authority is unclear.  ## Output Finance emits one of three states: - FINANCE_READY: B3 can execute inside the named money boundary. - NEEDS_MODEL: work returns to Finance/B2 for pricing/cost proof. - BLOCKED_LEAKAGE: work routes to Donna/DLQ or B1." ;
    aspace:seau <urn:aspace:01-projects-picard> ;
    dct:modified "2026-06-02" ;
    aspace:mots 162 .

