<urn:aspace:01-projects-picard-03-rilcot-members-space-os-b3-warp-core-execution-03-product-flash-avengers-jtbd-002-rilcot-transverse-product-offer-gate-md> a aspace:Document ;
    rdfs:label "JTBD-002 RILCOT Transverse Product Offer Gate  ## Job When 03 RILCOT Members Space OS prepares any offer, product package, service package, MVP, demo, feature, deliverable, or acceptance boundary, Product must verify scope and cross-domain readiness before Sales, Ops, or B3 execution proceeds.  ## Output A dated Product readiness decision: - PRODUCT_READY - NEEDS_SCOPE - BLOCKED_DELIVERY  ## Readiness Checks | Check | Question | | --- | --- | | Scope | What is included? | | Exclusions | What is not included? | | Acceptance | How is done proven? | | Demo/MVP | What does proof mean and not mean? | | Sales/Growth | Does promise match Product? | | Ops/IT | Can delivery/runtime support it? | | Finance | Does price match scope/cost? | | People/Legal | Who owns it and is IP/claims safe? |  ## Guardrail No member experience launches without scope, ritual owner, feedback loop, content boundary, and support path.  ## Proof Attach Product packet, scope, acceptance criteria, cross-domain approvals, and final Product decision." ;
    aspace:seau <urn:aspace:01-projects-picard> ;
    dct:modified "2026-06-02" ;
    aspace:mots 123 .

