    rdfs:label "JTBD-002 RILCOT Transverse Sales Revenue Gate  ## Job When 03 RILCOT Members Space OS prepares any proposal, quote, commitment, sales script, close motion, or revenue handoff, Sales must verify qualification and cross-domain readiness.  ## Output A dated Sales readiness decision: - SALES_READY - NEEDS_QUALIFICATION - BLOCKED_COMMITMENT  ## Readiness Checks | Check | Question | | --- | --- | | Diagnostic | What pain/fit evidence exists? | | Authority | Who can decide? | | Scope | What is included/excluded? | | Price | What is quoted and approved? | | Delivery | Can Product/Ops deliver? | | Legal | Are claims/terms safe? | | Handoff | Who owns next step? |  ## Guardrail No member commitment may be made without member fit, value promise, onboarding path, price/payment, and community owner.  ## Proof Attach Sales packet, proposal, cross-domain approvals, and final Sales decision." ;
