<urn:aspace:01-projects-picard-03-rilcot-members-space-os-b2-business-domains-03-product-flash-avengers-05-rilcot-product-transverse-offer-boundary-os-md> a aspace:Document ;
    rdfs:label "RILCOT Product Transverse Offer Boundary OS  ## Purpose Product is the transverse offer boundary gate for 03 RILCOT Members Space OS. It converts demand and sales intent into a scoped, testable, deliverable, supportable, priced, and legally bounded product/service system.  ## Operating Thesis RILCOT needs Product to define member experience, rituals, content, onboarding, and feedback loops as a deliverable system.  ## Eight-Domain Product Interface | Domain | Product Surface | Required Proof | | --- | --- | --- |" ;
    aspace:seau <urn:aspace:01-projects-picard> ;
    dct:modified "2026-06-02" ;
    aspace:mots 235 .

<urn:aspace:01-projects-picard-03-rilcot-members-space-os-b2-business-domains-03-product-flash-avengers-06-rilcot-b2-b3-product-delivery-protocol-md> a aspace:Document ;
    rdfs:label "RILCOT B2/B3 Product Delivery Protocol  ## Product Packet Every Product task that touches offer, package, MVP, demo, deliverable, service scope, QA, or acceptance must carry this packet:  project: 03 RILCOT Members Space OS b2_owner: Flash b3_swarm: Avengers growth_signal: sales_diagnostic: scope: exclusions: mvp_or_demo_boundary: acceptance_criteria: ops_handoff: it_runtime_boundary: finance_price_margin: people_owner: legal_ip_claims_boundary: decision:  ## Refusal Conditions Product blocks execution when: - scope is vague; - exclusions are missing; - acceptance criteria are absent; - Sales promise exceeds Product boundary; - Ops/IT/Finance/Legal dependencies are unresolved; - owner or reviewer is missing.  ## Output Product emits one of three states: - PRODUCT_READY - NEEDS_SCOPE - BLOCKED_DELIVERY" ;
    aspace:seau <urn:aspace:01-projects-picard> ;
    dct:modified "2026-06-02" ;
    aspace:mots 96 .

