    rdfs:label "RILCOT Sales Transverse Revenue Handoff OS  ## Purpose Sales is the transverse revenue handoff gate for 03 RILCOT Members Space OS. It converts qualified demand into bounded proposals, commitments, and handoffs without breaking Growth, Product, Ops, IT, Finance, People, or Legal constraints.  ## Operating Thesis RILCOT needs Sales to convert member/community interest into clear membership, onboarding, and value commitments.  ## Eight-Domain Sales Interface | Domain | Sales Surface | Required Proof | | --- | --- | --- |" ;
