<urn:aspace:01-projects-picard-02-abc-os-child-care-bos-b2-business-domains-03-product-flash-avengers-06-abc-b2-b3-product-delivery-protocol-md> a aspace:Document ;
    rdfs:label "ABC B2/B3 Product Delivery Protocol  ## Product Packet Every Product task that touches offer, package, MVP, demo, deliverable, service scope, QA, or acceptance must carry this packet:  project: 02 ABC OS & Child Care BOS b2_owner: Flash b3_swarm: Avengers growth_signal: sales_diagnostic: scope: exclusions: mvp_or_demo_boundary: acceptance_criteria: ops_handoff: it_runtime_boundary: finance_price_margin: people_owner: legal_ip_claims_boundary: decision:  ## Refusal Conditions Product blocks execution when: - scope is vague; - exclusions are missing; - acceptance criteria are absent; - Sales promise exceeds Product boundary; - Ops/IT/Finance/Legal dependencies are unresolved; - owner or reviewer is missing.  ## Output Product emits one of three states: - PRODUCT_READY - NEEDS_SCOPE - BLOCKED_DELIVERY" ;
